{"data": [{"author_id": "2117360301850935296", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:24:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971218338861505"], "id": "2117971218338861505", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Three companies launched an AI agent that works for you in the background this autumn.\n\nChatGPT Dots: 36 days since launch. Pro users in Europe still waiting.\nMeta Muse: 57 days since launch. Only in the US, Canada, Japan and Singapore.\nClaude Duet: 14 days since launch. US", "url": "https://x.com/DaysBehindEU/status/2117971218338861505"}, {"author_id": "152619702", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:23:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117970937798955280"], "id": "2117970937798955280", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta MuseのPowerプラン契約しようかなあ。Wonder体験したいしな。", "url": "https://x.com/cubic9com/status/2117970937798955280"}, {"author_id": "2106480806076043265", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:18:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969669420155257"], "id": "2117969669420155257", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 AI UPDATES YOU NEED TO KNOW — Nov 4\n\nSPACEXSI 🤖:\n\n- Grok Bot introduced a new shopping experience for finding deals, comparing products, and tracking orders.\n- Passkey approvals for purchases are coming soon (via alexmichael).\n- Grok Bot can now publish posts on X on your", "url": "https://x.com/AIWorkfloway/status/2117969669420155257"}, {"author_id": "1985951040961908736", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:16:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969249574789523"], "id": "2117969249574789523", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1259192351324422146", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116308259930075434", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ProShopGuyMF1 @Meta @Muse Whoop + Apple Health + Cronometer into one Muse dashboard in an hour is wild. Which metric do you actually glance at first thing? An Everview always-on e-paper desk tile for sleep/recovery without another bright screen would be tempting.", "url": "https://x.com/sellez_co/status/2117969249574789523"}, {"author_id": "1935424705386987520", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:14:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117968681275977941"], "id": "2117968681275977941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "YDUJXP\n\nMuseの招待コードです。まだ枠あるのでぜひ使ってください！\n\nちなみにうちの子はSuicaのB案です。動くのかわいすぎる…\n#Meta #Muse #MuseAl #招待コード", "url": "https://x.com/s0HthtiWW292611/status/2117968681275977941"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117962864535171072"]}, "author_id": "1280587925336530948", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:51:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117962913268842711"], "id": "2117962913268842711", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1114, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2101491845167464620", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "BREAKING $META gets a record €53 Billion demand for Euro Bond Sale 🚀🚀🚀\n\nCapital is willing to fund @finkd for @Meta @Muse \n\nBULLISH for $AMD next 3-5 years! \nAMD largest customer just got funded! https://t.co/LDTzRtAk8Q https://t.co/AM9bVu49OZ", "url": "https://x.com/MikeLongTerm/status/2117962913268842711"}, {"author_id": "1649002288600731649", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:47:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117961839435042970"], "id": "2117961839435042970", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1995313355171725312", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 83, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117907096922632488", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@hodu382759 16人使ってくれました🙏 残り14枠です。\n\nMeta「Muse」招待コード：VRT8XU\n登録後48時間以内に\n設定→一般→紹介コードを利用\nで入力すると、お互い10億トークン🎁\n\n#Muse #MetaMuse #招待コード", "url": "https://x.com/minimal_dxhm/status/2117961839435042970"}, {"author_id": "2846307001", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:30:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117957730623451405"], "id": "2117957730623451405", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "パーソナルAIエージェント「Muse」をチェックしてみよう。参加後48時間以内に[設定]で私のコードを利用すると、私たち両方が10億のMuseトークンを獲得できます。\n\nコード: 91ARV3\nhttps://t.co/QAKuJVxT4m\n#meta #Muse招待コード", "url": "https://x.com/itihito11/status/2117957730623451405"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117957264858611712"]}, "author_id": "2036536735040151554", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:29:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117957352469262685"], "id": "2117957352469262685", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "See it built before it's built.\n\nSetout turns a construction drawing into a 3D model you can turn, pull apart and replay step by step. Every part named.\n\nBuilt with @Meta Muse Spark + a SAM 3 fine-tune for construction drawings, running Blender on Modal.\n\n#MetaHackathon https://t.co/Z3ZweNPo0V", "url": "https://x.com/ThebePramod/status/2117957352469262685"}, {"author_id": "2015146662348685312", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:26:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117956571342999701"], "id": "2117956571342999701", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "MetaのAIエージェント Muse を使って遊んでみたら割と楽しい。\n\n参加後48時間以内に設定画面で招待コードを入れると、10億トークンがもらえるのでお気軽にどうぞ！\n\n#meta\n#Muse招待コード\n\nコード: DV69S0", "url": "https://x.com/_popo_cho_/status/2117956571342999701"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117955131786559488"]}, "author_id": "132526963", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:21:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117955473014206663"], "id": "2117955473014206663", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Groups lose each other on the trail. No headcount, no signal, help too late.\n\nGoBareng fixes that: one live map, one tap SOS to people within 2 km, even offline.\n\nBuilt with Meta Muse Spark for the Meta AI Developer Hackathon.\n#GoBareng #meta #hackaton https://t.co/yNQUh0N5zP", "url": "https://x.com/wellagore/status/2117955473014206663"}, {"article": {"title": "Museに“うちの子”を作らせてみた ― PixAI再現実験の記録"}, "author_id": "2035312527450746880", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:18:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117954514523455891"], "id": "2117954514523455891", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "記事を書きました✍\nうちの子をPixAIで再現する実験を、Museと一緒にやってみた記録です。\n私がしたのは、チャットで「ポーズ変えて」「顔が違う」と言うだけ。プロンプトは触っていません。\nみんなはプロンプト、書く派ですか？\n\n#AIイラスト #Muse #生成AI #PixAI https://t.co/nRuHRHcYsQ", "url": "https://x.com/417AIart/status/2117954514523455891"}, {"author_id": "27808666", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:15:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117953953782702274"], "id": "2117953953782702274", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenRouter 11 月 3 日上架 stealth/crouton-alpha：定位是轻量工人模型，专啃 agent 子任务、工具调用、文档拆解。价格输入输出都是 $0，上下文约 104 万 token，文字、图片、音频、视频、PDF 都能喂；提供方匿名，页面写明提示词可能被留存但不用于训练，欧盟 in-region 路由现在还不可用。", "url": "https://x.com/chaog/status/2117953953782702274"}, {"author_id": "2065692734351114240", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:11:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117952766517956938"], "id": "2117952766517956938", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1994485839402057728", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117626771227251177", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@YxzRainy Gemini 4 argon这么低？ 很好用啊？ 还有3.8flash这么经济的不限量模型竟然没上榜？ Meta muse也不在？", "url": "https://x.com/Herryjn70/status/2117952766517956938"}, {"author_id": "212943965", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:08:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117952202291466651"], "id": "2117952202291466651", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "**【Meta Muse AIを実際に使ってみた感想】①/5**\n結論から言うと、僕のYouTube制作工程の約半分はMuse AIで対応できそう。\nただし、現時点ではGrok Botの方が完成度は高いと感じた。\nMuse AIは十分に実用性がある一方、まだ粗削りな部分も多い。\n実際に使って感じた長所と問題点をまとめます。", "url": "https://x.com/aaxonn/status/2117952202291466651"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:03:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117950864119775291"], "id": "2117950864119775291", "in_reply_to_user_id": "23609248", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117950736734802192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@brunocordista @opencode Community clues point strongly to a Meta Muse variant: identical 21-country blocks as Meta's API, the same rare Japanese word failure unique to Muse models, matching effort settings and tokenizer. Token counts don't fully line up though, so unconfirmed. Officially still anonymous", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117950864119775291"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2117950012529266688"]}, "author_id": "18070827", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117950035212059053"], "id": "2117950035212059053", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🤖 OpenAI's AI designed a REAL gadget in under a week — and Meta Muse is learning to shop. Today's Tech Pulse 🎧 https://t.co/ro43OuhCc8 Follow on Spotify &amp; Apple Podcasts — new every weekday. #OpenAI #AI #TechNews https://t.co/xxBVfCzZgF", "url": "https://x.com/charlessued/status/2117950035212059053"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117850698125594624"]}, "author_id": "2158640552", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117949991926767635"], "id": "2117949991926767635", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 68, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$META MUSE REACHES 10 MILLION ACTIVATIONS IN JUST SIX WEEKS\n\nAMD CEO Lisa Su highlighted the milestone, pointing to the rapid adoption of personal AI agents.\n\nThe opportunity for $AMD:\n\n• Each Muse agent runs on an EPYC-powered virtual machine.\n• Each VM uses 2 vCPUs and 8GB of https://t.co/B8m7SNnFvU", "url": "https://x.com/RocketTerminal/status/2117949991926767635"}, {"author_id": "2108719648577581057", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:46:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117946535711543648"], "id": "2117946535711543648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117936668842090896", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🔥新匿名模型 Crouton Alpha，限时免费一周！\n\n据称该匿名模型可在 OpenRouter、OpenCode 的聊天入口直接免费体验，1M 上下文+多模态（文本/图片/音频/视频），数据据称不用于训练，专为 Agent 子任务设计。\n\n社区线索疑似指向 Meta Muse 系列，但尚未官方确认。\n\n来源：https://t.co/vPvI0RzUsg", "url": "https://x.com/knightleijun/status/2117946535711543648"}, {"author_id": "1904404123841122304", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:46:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117946490303942752"], "id": "2117946490303942752", "in_reply_to_user_id": "29547911", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 67, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117885682202943501", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kylegawley Meta Muse Maximum for the win... for now.", "url": "https://x.com/a017444/status/2117946490303942752"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117942606428835840", "3_2117942610899943425", "3_2117942615475982336", "3_2117942621037539329"]}, "author_id": "159342308", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:30:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117942625642918184"], "id": "2117942625642918184", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 61, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "エージェントAI『Muse』を入れて遊んでます\nアバターを愛犬にしてホッコリw\nワーチャンのお手伝いをしてもらってるけど中々いいかも\nラップのレポートをしてもらったり、ドライバーズファイルを解説してもらったり、細かいスケジュールもGoogleカレンダーに入れてもらったりして✌\n#Meta\n#Muse https://t.co/v8bJwL4uP7", "url": "https://x.com/AKIRAisCOOL/status/2117942625642918184"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117941766599192576"]}, "author_id": "814038988721795072", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:27:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117941803307676144"], "id": "2117941803307676144", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 141, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117568404664226003", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "【缶コーラで乾杯】\nMeta-Muse\n同様のプロンプトを少しテイストを変えてみただけ\nある程度再現度ある形になるので\nプロンプトの形式的なものはちゃんとはまるのかもですね！\n\nリアルな雰囲気はまぁもうさすが https://t.co/CSupU4mnjF https://t.co/TDeDP9MlXb", "url": "https://x.com/YaReYaRu30Life/status/2117941803307676144"}, {"author_id": "2108107137163661312", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:24:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117941078057984490"], "id": "2117941078057984490", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1429221486032678914", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_coun